  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 - stable release of Guardhouse SDK for .NET.\n\n            Features:\n            - Client credentials flow with token caching and refresh support\n            - JWT signature validation with JWKS caching and lazy refresh (RFC 7515)\n            - Token introspection support (RFC 7662) with micro-cache\n            - Configurable validation rules (issuer, audience, lifetime, algorithms, token types)\n            - HTTP resilience with Polly retry and timeout policies\n            - Clear configuration validation and diagnostics\n            - Support for .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0",
